<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR RATES MOSTLY STEADY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR RATES MOSTLY STEADY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 12-month rate rose one bps to 3.41 percent.</p>
<p>					May 27 fix	   May 26 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			 3.01 pct	     3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			 3.03 pct	     3.03 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			 3.07 pct	     3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			 3.18 pct	     3.18 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			 3.28 pct	     3.28 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			3.41 pct	     3.40 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
